meta-robobase
=============

This layer contains RoboBase-specific Yocto customizations for the MYIR
i.MX8M Plus board (`MACHINE=myd-jx8mp`).

Current contents
----------------

- `recipes-core/images/robobase-image.bb`
  Custom image target based on MYIR `myir-image-full`.
- `recipes-robobase/robobase-demo/test-yocto_0.1.bb`
  Minimal user-space test recipe used to verify that custom packages are built
  and installed into the final image.
- `recipes-robobase/robobase-rpmsg-test/robobase-rpmsg-test_0.1.bb`
  User-space RPMsg tty echo and RoboBase safety protocol test tool for the CM7
  `robobase_m7_rpmsg_tty_echo` firmware.

Layer setup
-----------

From the initialized Yocto build environment:

```bash
bitbake-layers add-layer /home/compile/workstation/project/codex/myplatform/platform/boards/myir_imx8m_plus/yocto/layers/meta-robobase
bitbake-layers show-layers
```

Expected layer entry:

```text
meta-robobase
```

Build targets
-------------

Build the test package only:

```bash
bitbake test-yocto
```

Build the RPMsg test tool only:

```bash
bitbake robobase-rpmsg-test
```

Build the RoboBase image:

```bash
bitbake robobase-image
```

The image recipe appends `test-yocto` and `robobase-rpmsg-test` to
`IMAGE_INSTALL`, so the target rootfs should contain:

```text
/usr/bin/test-yocto
/usr/bin/robobase-rpmsg-test
```

Before flashing, verify the package is present in the image manifest:

```bash
grep test-yocto tmp/deploy/images/myd-jx8mp/robobase-image-myd-jx8mp.manifest
grep robobase-rpmsg-test tmp/deploy/images/myd-jx8mp/robobase-image-myd-jx8mp.manifest
```

Board-side RPMsg echo test:

```bash
modprobe imx_rpmsg_tty
R=/sys/class/remoteproc/remoteproc0
echo robobase_m7_rpmsg_tty_echo.elf > "$R/firmware"
echo start > "$R/state"
robobase-rpmsg-test -d /dev/ttyRPMSG30 -n 10
```

Board-side RoboBase safety protocol test:

```bash
robobase-rpmsg-test --safety -d /dev/ttyRPMSG30 -n 10
robobase-rpmsg-test --safety -d /dev/ttyRPMSG30 --upstream-invalid
robobase-rpmsg-test --safety -d /dev/ttyRPMSG30 --clear-fault 0xffffffff
```

The safety protocol ABI is defined in:

```text
platform/common/include/robobase/rb_safety_proto.h
```

Flashing artifact
-----------------

Use the full `.wic` disk image for TF card or UUU flashing:

```text
tmp/deploy/images/myd-jx8mp/robobase-image-myd-jx8mp.wic
```

Do not flash the `.ext4` file as a full disk image; it is only the rootfs
partition image.
